emini-3-Pro. Crucially, I\u0027m working out the API key selection process and how to structure the project files. I\u0027m working out the core design now.\\n\\n\\n**Defining API Implementation**\\n\\nI\u0027ve got the API key selection process nailed down; it uses `window.aistudio.openSelectKey()`. I\u0027m going with `gemini-3-pro-image-preview` for high-quality image generation and potentially `googleSearch` if needed. I\u0027m focusing on the `DreamEntry` data structure, incorporating ID, date, transcription, image URL, interpretation, and chat history. Also, I\u0027m using `MediaRecorder` for dream recording and plan to transcribe with Gemini, maybe using the audio part with the regular `generateContent`. I\u0027m considering using Gemini-3-Pro-Preview for Jungian analysis, and I am focused on the image generation prompt to ensure a Surrealist style. I\u0027m also planning to incorporate self-correction into the transcription.\\n\\n\\n\",\"cMarkNode\":{}},\"createdTimestamp\":{\"seconds\":1770114003,\"nanos\":684000000},\"doneTimestamp\":{\"seconds\":1770114011,\"nanos\":847000000}},{\"id\":2,\"author\":\"model\",\"payload\":{\"type\":\"generationTable\",\"entries\":[{\"path\":\"metadata.json\",\"generationType\":0,\"isDone\":true,\"description\":\"App metadata and permissions for microphone usage.\",\"diffs\":[{\"target\":\"\",\"replacement\":\"\\n{\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"Oneiros: Surreal Dream Journal\\\",\\n  \\\"description\\\": \\\"A multi-modal dream journal that transcribes your night visions, generates surrealist art from your subconscious themes, and provides Jungian psychological analysis.\\\",\\n  \\\"requestFramePermissions\\\": [\\n    \\\"microphone\\\"\\n  ]\\n}\\n\"}]},{\"path\":\"index.html\",\"generationType\":0,\"isDone\":true,\"description\":\"Primary entry point with Tailwind CSS and FontAwesome for icons.\",\"diffs\":[{\"target\":\"\",\"replacement\":\"\\n\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\\n\u003chtml lang\u003d\\\"en\\\"\u003e\\n  \u003chead\u003