e are emotional cues, note them in brackets.\\\" }\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    });\\n    return response.text || \\\"Transcription failed.\\\";\\n  }\\n\\n  async interpretDream(transcription: string): Promise\u003cstring\u003e {\\n    const response \u003d await this.ai.models.generateContent({\\n      model: \u0027gemini-3-pro-preview\u0027,\\n      contents: `Analyze the following dream transcription using Jungian psychological archetypes. Identify core symbols, emotional themes, and a potential message from the subconscious. Structure it clearly with sections:\\n      - Core Archetypes\\n      - Emotional Landscape\\n      - Subconscious Insight\\n      \\n      Dream text: ${transcription}`,\\n    });\\n    return response.text || \\\"Interpretation failed.\\\";\\n  }\\n\\n  async generateSurrealImage(transcription: string, resolution: ImageResolution): Promise\u003cstring | undefined\u003e {\\n    const prompt \u003d `A highly detailed surrealist painting in the style of Salvador Dalí and Rene Magritte, representing the core emotional themes and imagery of this dream: \\\"${transcription}\\\". Deep subconscious atmosphere, ethereal lighting, dreamlike physics.`;\\n    \\n    const response \u003d await this.ai.models.generateContent({\\n      model: \u0027gemini-3-pro-image-preview\u0027,\\n      contents: {\\n        parts: [{ text: prompt }],\\n      },\\n      config: {\\n        imageConfig: {\\n          aspectRatio: \\\"1:1\\\",\\n          imageSize: resolution\\n        },\\n        tools: [{ google_search: {} }], // Available for gemini-3-pro-image-preview\\n      },\\n    });\\n\\n    for (const part of response.candidates[0].content.parts) {\\n      if (part.inlineData) {\\n        return `data:image/png;base64,${part.inlineData.data}`;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return undefined;\\n  }\\n\\n  async chatAboutSymbols(transcription: string, history: ChatMessage[], newMessage: string): Promise\u003cstring\u003e {\\n    const chat \u003d this.ai.chats.create({\\n      model: \u0027gemini-3-pro-preview\u0027,\\n      config: {\\n        systemInstruction: `You are an expert dream analyst and Jungian psychologist. The user is asking about a dream they had: \\\"${transcription}\\\". Answer their questions about specific symbols, feelings, or themes with psychological depth and empathy.`,\\n      },\\n    });\\n\\n    // Reconstruct history\\n    // We send messages sequentially to build context in a simple implementation\\n    let lastResponse \u003d \\\"\\\";\\n    const response \u003d await chat.sendMessage({ message: newMessage });\\n    return response.text || \\\"No response.\\\";\\n  }\\n}\\n\"}]},{\"path\":\"App.tsx\",\"generationType\":0,\"isDone\":true,\"description\":\"Main application component with navigation, state management, and API key handling.\",\"diffs\":[{\"target\":\"\",\"replacement\":\"\\nimport React, { useState, useEffect, useCallback } from \u0027react\u0027;\\nimport { DreamEntry, ImageResolution } from \u0027./types\u0027;\\nimport { GeminiService } from \u0027./services/geminiService\u0027;\\nimport DreamRecorder from \u0027./components/DreamRecorder\u0027;\\nimport DreamCard from \u0027./components/DreamCard\u0027;\\n\\nconst App: React.FC \u003d () \u003d\u003e {\\n  const [entries, setEntries] \u003d useState\u003cDreamEntry[]\u003e([]);\\n  const [hasApiKey, setHasApiKey] \u003d useState\u003cboolean\u003e(false);\\n  const [isRecordingModalOpen, setIsRecordingModalOpen] \u003d useState(false);\\n  const [activeTab, setActiveTab] \u003d useState\u003c\u0027journal\u0027 | \u0027about\u0027\u003e(\u0027journal\u0027);\\n\\n  useEffect(() \u003d\u003e {\\n    const checkKey \u003d async () \u003d\u003e {\\n      // @ts-ignore\\n      const has \u003d await window.aistudio.hasSelectedApiKey();\\n      setHasApiKey(has);\\n    };\\n    checkKey();\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const handleOpenKeySelector \u003d async () \u003d\u003e {\\n    // @ts-ignore\\n    await window.aistudio.openSelectKey();\