the raw, unedited language of your subconscious.\\n          \u003c/p\u003e\\n          \u003cp className\u003d\\\"mb-4\\\"\u003e\\n            Utilizing the advanced \u003cstrong\u003eGemini 3 Pro\u003c/strong\u003e models, Oneiros transcribes your voice, \\n            interprets complex Jungian symbols, and manifests your inner visions into surrealist art.\\n          \u003c/p\u003e\\n          \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-8\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"p-4 border border-white/10 rounded-xl bg-white/5\\\"\u003e\\n              \u003ci className\u003d\\\"fa-solid fa-microphone text-pink-500 mb-2\\\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\\n              \u003ch3 className\u003d\\\"font-bold text-white mb-1\\\"\u003eCapture\u003c/h3\u003e\\n              \u003cp className\u003d\\\"text-xs\\\"\u003eVoice-to-text ensures every detail is preserved.\u003c/p\u003e\\n            \u003c/div\u003e\\n            \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"p-4 border border-white/10 rounded-xl bg-white/5\\\"\u003e\\n              \u003ci className\u003d\\\"fa-solid fa-brain text-pink-500 mb-2\\\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\\n              \u003ch3 className\u003d\\\"font-bold text-white mb-1\\\"\u003eAnalyze\u003c/h3\u003e\\n              \u003cp className\u003d\\\"text-xs\\\"\u003eDeep archetypal analysis reveals hidden meanings.\u003c/p\u003e\\n            \u003c/div\u003e\\n            \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"p-4 border border-white/10 rounded-xl bg-white/5\\\"\u003e\\n              \u003ci className\u003d\\\"fa-solid fa-palette text-pink-500 mb-2\\\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\\n              \u003ch3 className\u003d\\\"font-bold text-white mb-1\\\"\u003eVisualize\u003c/h3\u003e\\n              \u003cp className\u003d\\\"text-xs\\\"\u003eSurrealist imagery brings your dreams to life.\u003c/p\u003e\\n            \u003c/div\u003e\\n          \u003c/div\u003e\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* Floating Action Button */}\\n      \u003c