scription and interpretation in the share data. As the images are base64-encoded, I\u0027m working to convert them into a File object before sharing. If `navigator.share` fails, I\u0027ll fallback to `navigator.clipboard.writeText`.\\n\\n\\n**Refining Image Sharing**\\n\\nOkay, the share implementation within `DreamCard.tsx` is moving forward! I\u0027ve now added functionality to handle image sharing as well. My focus has shifted slightly. I\u0027m prioritizing sharing the image, if available, by converting the base64-encoded image into a Blob, and then a File object. I\u0027ve updated the shareData object to support this. If image sharing fails, I\u0027ll fallback to copying the dream text and URL to the clipboard.\\n\\n\\n\",\"cMarkNode\":{}},\"createdTimestamp\":{\"seconds\":1770114063,\"nanos\":851000000},\"doneTimestamp\":{\"seconds\":1770114077,\"nanos\":677000000}},{\"id\":6,\"author\":\"model\",\"payload\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"To add the sharing functionality, I will update the `DreamCard` component. This will include a new \\\"Share\\\" button in the dream header and a `handleShare` function that utilizes the Web Share API to share the dream\u0027s text and, if possible, the generated surrealist image. If the Web Share API is not supported by the browser, it will fall back to copying the dream summary to the clipboard.\\n\\n(i) **Updates to `DreamCard.tsx`**:\\n- Added a `handleShare` asynchronous function.\\n- This function attempts to convert the base64 dream image into a `File` object for sharing.\\n- It uses `navigator.share` to trigger the native share dialog with the dream\u0027s transcription, a snippet of the interpretation, and the image file.\\n- Added a new button next to the \\\"Inquire\\\" button in the card header.\\n\\n(ii) **Behavior**:\\n- When clicked, the app attempts to open the system\u0027s native share menu (on mobile or supported desktop browsers).\\n- It bundles the text description and the image together.\\n- If sharing fails or is unsupported, it displays a subtle alert and copies the dream text to the user\u0027s clipboard as a fallback.\\n\\n(iii) **Visual Appearance**:\\n- The \\\"Share\\\" button matches the existing design aesthetic: a translucent `dream-card` style button with a `fa-share-nodes` icon.\\n- It is placed conveniently in the header of each dream entry, maintaining the clean, minimalist look of the journal.\\n\\n\",\"cMarkNode\":{}},\"createdTimestamp\":{\"seconds\":1770114077,\"nanos\":678000000},\"doneTimestamp\":{\"seconds\":1770114077,\"nanos\":681000000}},{\"id\":7,\"author\":\"model\",\"payload\":{\"type\":\"generationTable\",\"entries\":[{\"path\":\"components/DreamCard.tsx\",\"generationType\":1,\"isDone\":true,\"description\":\"Added Share Dream functionality using Web Share API with clipboard fallback.\",\"diffs\":[{\"target\":\"\",\"replacement\":\"\\nimport React, { useState } from \u0027react\u0027;\\nimport { DreamEntry, ChatMessage } from \u0027../types\u0027;\\nimport { GeminiService } from \u0027../services/geminiService\u0027;\\n\\ninterface DreamCardProps {\\n  entry: DreamEntry;\\n}\\n\\nconst DreamCard: React.FC\u003cDreamCardProps\u003e \u003d ({ entry }) \u003d\u003e {\\n  const [isChatOpen, setIsChatOpen] \u003d useState(false);\\n  const [chatHistory, setChatHistory] \u003d useState\u003cChatMessage[]\u003e(entry.chatHistory);\\n  const [inputValue, setInputValue] \u003d useState(\\\"\\\");\\n  const [isTyping, setIsTyping] \u003d useState(false);\\n\\n  const handleShare \u003d async () \u003d\u003e {\\n    try {\\n      const files: File[] \u003d [];\\n      \\n      // If there\u0027s an image, try to prepare it for sharing\\n      if (entry.imageUrl) {\\n        const response \u003d await fetch(entry.imageUrl);\\n        const blob \u003d await response.blob();\\n        const file \u003d new File([blob], `dream-${entry.id}.png`, { type: \u0027image/png\u0027 });\\n        files.push(file);\\n      }\\n\\n      const shareData: any \u003d {\\n        title: \u0027A Vision from my Subconscious\u0027,\\n        text: `I just recorded this dream in Oneiros:\\\\n\\\\n\\\"${entry.transcription}\\\"\\\\n\\\\nInterpretation: ${entry.interpretation?.substring(0, 200)}...`,\\n        url: window.location.href,\\n      };\\n\\n      // Check if sharing files is supported\\n      if (files.length \u003e 0 \u0026\u0026 navigator.canShare \u0026\u0026 navigator.canShare({ files })) {\\n        shareData.files \u003d files;\\n      }\\n\\n      if (navigator.share) {\\n        await navigator.share(shareData);\\n      } else {\\n        throw new Error(\u0027Web Share API not available\u0027);\\n      }\\n    } catch (err) {\\n      console.warn(\\\"Native share failed, falling back to clipboard:\\\", err);\\n      const textToCopy \u003d `DREAM: ${entry.transcription}\\\\n\\\\nANALYSIS: ${entry.interpretation}`;\\n      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(textToCopy);\\n      alert(\\\"Dream details copied to clipboard!\\\");\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleSendMessage \u003d async (e: React.FormEvent) \u003d\u003e {\\n    e.preventDefault();\\n    if (!inputValue.trim() || isTyping) return;\\n\\n    const userMsg: ChatMessage \u003d { role: \u0027user\u0027, content: inputValue };\\n    const newHistory \u003d [...chatHistory, userMsg];\\n    setChatHistory(newHistory);\\n    setInputValue(\\\"\\\");\\n    setIsTyping(true);\\n\\n    try {\\n      const gemini \u003d new GeminiService();\\n      const response \u003d await gemini.chatAboutSymbols(entry.transcription, chatHistory, inputValue);\\n      setChatHistory([...newHistory, { role: \u0027model\u0027, content: response }]);\\n    } catch (err) {\\n      console.error(err);\\n      setChatHistory([...newHistory, { role: \u0027model\u0027, content: \\\"I\u0027m having trouble connecting to the collective unconscious right now.\\\" }]);\\n    } finally {\\n      setIsTyping(false);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const formattedDate \u003d new Date(entry.timestam